(text "BACK / REAR PHOTO VIEW\nJ1 (5V) top-left; A1 (CLK) top-right\nSocket IDs are immutable; this is NOT a footprint view." (at 28 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "694c6bf1-7687-5c82-ac3e-49dde90b17d9"))
(text "USB-powered DevKit; J1 / 5V feeds only the status ring (J5).\nJ19 supplies +3V3. All three GND sockets connected.\nOnboard USB-UART, regulator, BOOT and EN retained.\nPAIR is the onboard BOOT button (GPIO0, A6): no carrier wiring; A6 stays NC.\nDISPLAY STRAP: A7 (GPIO4) tied to GND = OLED board." (at 28 157 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "95b20a59-abd6-5cc6-a5a9-f871e447e7ae"))
(text "DISPLAY" (at 175 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "918b9a6a-a89e-5b4a-ba65-5ba264b74363"))
