(text "Wire colors are the breadboard jumpers in the owner photos\n(2026-09-24), not a harness specification.\nInland 1.3\" OLED V2.0 (KS0056), 4-wire SPI, 3.3 V.\nSH1106 128x64 inferred from the vendor example.\nJ2 pins follow the board header, pin 1 = GND (top).\nGPIO21 (A14, the e-ink BUSY) is the Right button (SW4) here." (at 175 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "88cff51b-4a30-5ab6-bb11-46a4ccc72706"))
