(text "Five discrete momentary pushbuttons (normally open), each from\nits GPIO to one shared GND rail; the ESP32 internal pull-ups need\nno resistors. Pin 1 = GPIO side, pin 2 = GND. On a 4-leg tactile\nswitch use two legs on opposite sides (across the gap).\nUp/Down move the menu list, Select or Right choose, Left closes.\nPair is the DevKit BOOT button. Firmware: Sigil env sigil-oled." (at 290 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "12e7ac5c-b761-5979-8882-5309ee4b9a7b"))
(text "STATUS RING" (at 290 125 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fa4f6792-317c-55e0-ac2b-f68c5427388d"))
